             + MoreDetailsPanel.cs (WinUI view).
Data       : GET /drives/{driveID} (Operations.Drives.Detail, path param driveID) via the shared
             CacheThenNetworkEngine -> IMoreDetailsPanelSource (P1/S8). The raw DriveDetail JSON (Drive
             aggregate + embedded telemetry[]/positions[]) is reduced to a unit-independent SI snapshot, exactly
             mirroring web useDriveDetailData; projection converts at the render boundary. No HTTP in the view.
Hooks bound: useTranslation -> ILocalizer (P1/S10) ; useUnits -> UnitPref + UnitConverters/UnitLabels (P1/S9).
Stats parity (web useDriveDetailData, reproduced in SI then converted):
  avgPowerKw = avg_power_w/1000 ?? mean(telemetry power) ;
  energyWh   = energy_used_wh ?? |avgPowerKw|*durationH*1000 ;
  regenWh    = regen_energy_wh ?? sum(|power| where power<0)*(durationH/rows)*1000 ;
  consumption= distance_m>0 ? energyWh/(distance_m/1000) : 0  (* 1.609344 when distance unit = mi) ;
  elevGain/Loss = sum of pos/neg consecutive elevation diffs (raw metres) ;
  minSpeed   = min(speed>0) ; avgOut/InTemp = mean(non-null) ;
  odometer/range start+end = first/last positive odometer / first+last ideal??rated range ;
  batteryUsed% = start_battery_pct - end_battery_pct.
