  Primary(6): Odometer(from→to), Range(start→end|?), Elevation(gain↑/loss↓), Energy Consumed(kWh/Wh switch at
              1000 Wh), Energy Recovered, Consumption(Wh/km|Wh/mi).
  Secondary : Avg Power(kW), [Avg Outside Temp], [Avg Inside Temp] (both conditional on non-null, web parity),
              Min Speed, Battery Used(%), Net Consumption(kWh/Wh).
